WEBVTT

00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:16,980
What are your thoughts on cortical steroids, like flow days, nasal sprays, or allergies or steroid inhalers for asthma?

00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,980
Um, management.

00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:28,980
Well, again, I'm one of those functional doctors who believe that sometimes the use of medication is wise.

00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:35,980
So, I don't think that it's healthy to take a dogmatic position against those things like all because they're medication.

00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,980
I never want to use them.

00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:40,980
But, I also think it's foolish to take a dogmatic position.

00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:44,980
I don't want doctor to take this, or this seems to work for me.

00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:48,980
So, I'm just going to keep taking it blindly without doing some research.

00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
So, I think you have to have a balanced approach.

00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:55,980
I think there's oftentimes a need for using cortical steroids.

00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:59,980
Oftentimes, indeed, for using asthma medication on a daily basis.

00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:02,980
Lots of times, it needs to be taking medication on a daily basis.

00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:07,980
But if you're not asking deeper questions, like, why do I have asthma?

00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:10,980
And I need to get to the bottom of this.

00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:14,980
Then I think you're, that's, that's not wise at all.

00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:26,980
So, I think we need to dig to find the causes of our disorders instead of thinking that we are the victim of some named disease.

00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:30,980
Oh, I am asthma. My mom had asthma. My sister has asthma.

00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:33,980
It runs into the family. Oh, does it?

00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:40,980
Or do you all have a sensitivity because of a familial trait that you all lived in a multi-house?

00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:44,980
Or that you all ate the same foods? Or what is it?

00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,980
You've got to dig to the bottom of this.

00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:55,980
So, finding out in case of asthma, it's very often healing the gutted, healing food sensitivities.

00:01:55,980 --> 00:02:01,980
That is a key component of actually getting a person off of the long-term asthma medication.

